# Exception: the finetuned GOAT detector IS the deliverable of TRAIN_YOLO.md and
# collaborators need it to run the eval at all. 6 MB, so tracking it directly is
# reasonable; anything larger should go to a GitHub Release instead.
# (Note the blanket rule above is 'checkpoints/*', not 'checkpoints/' -- git
# cannot un-ignore a file inside an excluded directory.)
!checkpoints/yolo_goat.pt

